From now on:
  - Push to main → live site rebuilds
  - Push to v2-rework → preview URL rebuilds
  - They're fully isolated — break v2-rework as much as you want, main is untouched

  When v2 is ready to replace v1: git checkout main && git merge v2-rework && git push origin main. Amplify deploys the new
   version, and v1 tag still preserves the old one.